        needBirthdateNotice: "Add your child's birthdate in your profile to turn on this comparison.",
        notBornYetNotice: "Invalid entry: a measurement can't be dated before the child's birth. Check the recorded birthdate under \"My children\" (it may still hold the expected due date instead of the actual birth date).",
